{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"{\n  \"observed_vs_expected\": \"The experiment did not execute (run_status: 'not_run', rounds_executed: 0). Consequently, no best_target_score, mean reflectance, or tightest_margin was observed. The expected observation of valid_candidates > 0 is contradicted by the actual measurement of valid_candidates = 0. No data exists to evaluate convergence or boundary pushing.\",\n  \"deviation_mechanism\": \"The route failed at the pre-execution validation stage because the constraint space contains zero physically realizable solutions under the current definitions. With valid_candidates = 0 and no candidates generated, the optimizer never ran. This indicates that the initial parameter bounds (likely thicknesses constrained to 40-160 nm as per stop_conditions context) combined with the material properties and target spectral requirements are mutually exclusive. The physical mechanism is a hard constraint violation in the design space initialization, preventing any optical simulation from occurring.\",\n  \"continue_recommended\": true,\n  \"continue_rationale\": \"Although the result is a failure (0 candidates), it represents only 0 executed rounds. The exploration rule mandates continuing until the hard scheduler limit is reached or there is enough evidence for a defensible no-benefit conclusion. A single failure to compile/run due to infeasible constraints is a reason to propose a repair (relaxing constraints or changing materials) and continue, not a reason to stop immediately, as we have not yet tested if relaxing these constraints yields a viable solution. We need at least one successful execution to determine if the topology is fundamentally unsuitable or just poorly bounded.\",\n  \"insight_for_next\": \"Relax the thickness constraint boundaries (e.g., expand from [40, 160] nm to [20, 200] nm) or adjust the total thickness budget to allow the optimizer to find a feasible starting point. Re-initialize the search with these expanded bounds to generate valid candidates.\",\n  \"insight_grounding\": \"Evidence: observed_metrics.valid_candidates = 0. Stop condition reference: 'If valid_candidates = 0, judge constraint set infeasible -> should relax total thickness budget'. Since no candidates were generated, the current bounds are strictly infeasible.\",\n  \"stop_basis\": \"\"\n}","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1791870994,"id":"chatcmpl-71e3c225-dbde-9f9b-ae05-087f4ddf2baf","model":"qwen3.7-flash","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":470,"prompt_tokens":1966,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"text_tokens":1966},"total_tokens":2436}}